    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "GLENBOWER, INCHIQUIN, KILLEAGH, CO. CORK, P36 HD51\r\nDNG Spillane are delighted to present Glenbower, Inchiquin, Killeagh, a beautifully maintained four-bedroom detached bungalow set on an exceptionally private and mature site extending to approximately 0.44 acres. Nestled in a peaceful countryside setting yet within easy reach of Killeagh, Youghal and some of East Cork's finest beaches, this is an outstanding opportunity to acquire a spacious family home in a highly desirable location.\r\nExtending to approximately 143 sq.m., the property has been lovingly cared for over the years and offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation throughout. Surrounded by mature hedging and landscaped gardens, the home enjoys an excellent degree of privacy while providing generous outdoor space for families, gardening enthusiasts or those simply looking to enjoy a tranquil rural lifestyle.\r\nInternally, the accommodation is thoughtfully laid out and comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a spacious living room featuring a beautiful natural stone fireplace, a large open-plan kitchen and dining area overlooking the gardens, a separate utility room, four well-proportioned bedrooms and a family bathroom. The layout is practical and functional, making it an ideal home for growing families or those looking for comfortable single-storey living.\r\nOutside, the impressive site is one of the property's standout features. The beautifully maintained gardens offer expansive lawns, mature trees, colourful planting and numerous areas to sit and relax in complete privacy. A detached garage positioned to the side of the property provides excellent storage, workshop space or further potential, subject to any necessary planning permissions.\r\nThe location offers the perfect balance of peaceful countryside living while remaining close to a wealth of amenities. Killeagh village is just a short drive away, offering schools, shops, cafés and everyday services, while the vibrant seaside town of Youghal provides supermarkets, restaurants, sporting facilities and a beautiful waterfront. Some of East Cork's most renowned beaches, including Inch Beach, Redbarn and Garryvoe, are all within easy reach, making this an ideal location for those who enjoy coastal walks, swimming and outdoor pursuits. Cork City is also easily accessible, making Glenbower an excellent option for commuters seeking a quieter lifestyle without sacrificing convenience.\r\nThis is a wonderful opportunity to purchase a spacious family home on a superb private site in one of East Cork's most attractive residential settings."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tSpacious four-bedroom detached bungalow extending to approximately 143 sq.m. \r\n•\tSet on a beautifully private site of approximately 0.44 acres. \r\n•\tDetached garage offering excellent storage or workshop space. \r\n•\tBright and well-maintained accommodation throughout. \r\n•\tLarge kitchen/dining area ideal for family living. \r\n•\tSpacious living room with attractive natural stone fireplace. \r\n•\tOil-fired central heating.  \r\n•\tBeautifully landscaped mature gardens with excellent privacy. \r\n•\tConveniently located close to Killeagh, Youghal and a selection of East Cork beaches. \r\n•\tExcellent family home with peaceful countryside surroundings. \r\n•\tEasy commute to Cork City."
      },
